  "changes": [
    "new and changed passwords use Argon2id",
    "legacy PBKDF2 SHA-512 and SHA-256 hashes remain login compatible",
    "legacy login never silently rewrites the stored hash",
    "successful legacy login displays a once-per-session migration prompt",
    "migration requires the current password again and preserves the password, Passkeys, TOTP, recovery codes and current session",
    "settings page provides a manual migration action when the prompt is postponed",
    "legacy weak but correctly verified passwords can migrate without lockout while new passwords still enforce strength policy",
    "Argon2 parameters are bounded before allocation and derivation concurrency is capped at two"
